[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5340.47, "timestamp": "01:29:00", "text": "说。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5342.39, "timestamp": "01:29:02", "text": "感觉就像你在跟一堆垃圾玩游戏，你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5345.03, "timestamp": "01:29:05", "text": "磨碎的东西，你还记得吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5346.91, "timestamp": "01:29:06", "text": "元素反应，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5348.83, "timestamp": "01:29:08", "text": "你的一切"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5352.11, "timestamp": "01:29:12", "text": "呃，你呃，好像停止播放它一段时间了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5354.629, "timestamp": "01:29:14", "text": "虽然你可以随时返回游戏，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5357.43, "timestamp": "01:29:17", "text": "这样做会产生很多内容。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5360.55, "timestamp": "01:29:20", "text": "然后你就忘记了基本的东西，忘记了如何……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5364.709, "timestamp": "01:29:24", "text": "基本的东西。差不多就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5368.39, "timestamp": "01:29:28", "text": "哦耶，耶，耶，耶。我也辞职了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5370.189, "timestamp": "01:29:30", "text": "因为我想要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5373.669, "timestamp": "01:29:33", "text": "Jean Jean和我就是没办法让她上床。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5375.75, "timestamp": "01:29:35", "text": "第一次滚动还是不是第一次滚动在她身上"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5377.79, "timestamp": "01:29:37", "text": "横幅。我没能得到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5386.55, "timestamp": "01:29:46", "text": "现在角色真多。是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5388.99, "timestamp": "01:29:48", "text": "你有很多角色，所以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5393.149, "timestamp": "01:29:53", "text": "有很多事情要做。太过了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5395.35, "timestamp": "01:29:55", "text": "磨砺。你必须处理的东西那么多"}]